# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build toolchain (bundled Zig + compiler caches) — re-downloadable, ~25k files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/build-tools/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Compiled output — rebuild with: build.ps1
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.exe
*.dll
*.lib
*.a
*.o
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.res
*.map

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated icons are COMMITTED on purpose. Rasterizing them needs headless Edge, and making
# that a build dependency hung CI for 15 minutes on the first run: a fresh clone has no
# generated icons, so the build launched a browser ~30 times. Committing the artifacts means
# `build.ps1` compiles identical bytes with no browser at all.
#   Tray .ico   -> icons\build-icons.ps1
#   Panel .png  -> tools\build-panel-icons.ps1
#   PanelIconsData.h is the header generated from those .png files.
# Only the verification contact sheets stay ignored; they are output, not input.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/icons/verify.png
/icons/verify-tray.png
/icons/verify-panel.png

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime state written next to the app, including copies in subdirectories.
# Ignore rules do not remove these files from manually created release archives.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
settings.ini
settings.ini.tmp
settings.ini.cpubak
diagnostics.txt
brightness-recovery.bin
stats.bin
*.log
*.dmp

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local secrets and signing material (safe templates can still be committed)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.template
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
*.kdbx
/secrets/
/credentials/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor / OS noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent working notes (not source)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/docs/superpowers/
/.codex/

# Local probes and scratch files, also excluded in this checkout's info/exclude.
# Keep these rules shared so they survive a fresh clone or folder copy.
/ScreenOffProbe.cpp
/tools/check-lock-on-display-off.ps1
/opencode-color-palettes.html
